      "writtenOn": "2025-05-14T08:54:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see a problem with returning to the host, but this shouldn\u0027t be done from this context IMO. Is there any reason to wait for the FFA_VERSION call to send the host availability message? If not, we could simply do that closer to hyp_ffa_init() when the FF-A proxy gets initialized, in a dedicated hypercall for simplicity.",
      "parentUuid": "091eb019_c1d78d48",
      "revId": "3f52acc51e52460793d729815c7525273e7a46de",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
