        "id": 1942270
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-12T14:27:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If TZ will get a non-secure interrupt the `smc` will return with interrupted and the destruction message wouldn\u0027t go through. We will then return to the host caller in `arch/arm64/kvm/pkvm.c` and we will handle the control to the host before retrying the next time.",
      "parentUuid": "809ad9a6_a0f42a66",
      "revId": "3f52acc51e52460793d729815c7525273e7a46de",
